{
  "visualDirection": "Compact menu-bar Parcel with a centered themed glass notch shelf; top-edge reveal; direct Dial/Grid/List switching; native clipboard intake and drag-out; configurable global and in-shelf shortcuts; single pinned parcel; local search/filters; contextual Shift-drag conversion ribbon; local OCR/document/spreadsheet transforms; watched folders; ribbon/catch motion.",
  "nativeVerification": "140 Swift cases (51 core + 89 app; one optional preview export skipped), generated conversion-matrix and themed layout artifacts, packed-ZIP clipboard verification, Carbon hot-key event delivery, live compact notch/settings review, live Command-S and Command-P shelf shortcuts, native modern and legacy file-drag payloads, image/archive smoke, packaged App Intents metadata and ad-hoc bundle validation. Physical cross-app modifier-drag timing, WhatsApp/Telegram destination acceptance, multiple physical displays and OS-accessibility acceptance remain manual release checks; no commit/merge.",
